  "description": "The world is filled with strange, inexplicable events that defy human explanation - and that’s where the Anomaly Management Center comes in. As the chief of this highly-specialized task force, Ha Seungchan is ready to deal with just about anything…or so he thought. When one particular anomaly enters the body of star baseball player Seon Yujin, it awakens the athlete’s beastly instincts and leaves him looking a little fluffier than usual. After joining the team, Yujin follows Seungchan to a massive black cube floating in the sky…but once inside, a dizzying game of disorder and desire takes the two on an unexpected and wild ride.\n\n(Source: LezhinUS)",
